---
title: Order checkout
---
sequenceDiagram
    %% an API flow of the kind colleagues write
    autonumber
    actor user as Customer
    participant web as Web app
    participant api as Checkout API
    participant pay as Payment provider
    participant db as Orders DB

    user->>web: Click "Pay now"
    web->>+api: POST /checkout
    api->>db: Load basket
    db-->>api: Basket
    alt basket is empty
        api-->>web: 400 Empty basket
        web-->>user: Show error
    else basket has items
        api->>+pay: Charge card
        Note right of pay: May take a few seconds
        alt card accepted
            pay-->>api: Accepted
            api->>db: Save order
            api-->>web: 201 Created
            web-->>user: Show receipt
        else card declined
            pay--xapi: Declined
            api-->>web: 402 Declined
            web-->>user: Ask for another card
        end
        deactivate pay
    end
    deactivate api
